Package: tennismatches
Type: Package
Title: Career Matches of Tennis Players from Tennis Abstract
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jessica", "Nguyen", email = "jessicaxiun@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves and cleans the career match data of a tennis player
    from tennisabstract.com, and draws a scatter plot of the age difference
    between the player and each opponent across the player's career.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2, httr2, jsonlite, rlang
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
